s, and mastering the challenges of the open world. Quests will test your capabilities, requiring the right steed, excellent riding mastery, and thoughtful planning, as well as skillful resource management, useful crafting, and keen archery to survive and succeed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697000/extras/c2ab013c93596b08ad4887973a44449e.poster.avif?t=1772614810\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697000/extras/c2ab013c93596b08ad4887973a44449e.webm?t=1772614810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697000/extras/c2ab013c93596b08ad4887973a44449e.mp4?t=1772614810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Aesir Interactive","NightinGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697000/58512e9ea2f796098e09e6edae8315258259ccc8/header.jpg?t=1772614810","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Developed by Aesir Interactive GmbH and NightinGames UG.<br />\r\nPublished by Mindscape B.V. \u00a92025 Mindscape\u00ae and the Mindscape\u00ae Logo are registered trademarks of Elementalz B.V. and its affiliates. \u00a92025 All rights reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFinancially supported by the FFF Bayern.<br />\r\nFinancially supported by the BMWK of the German Bundestag.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\"The Legend of Khiimori\" uses Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal\u00ae Engine, Copyright 1998 \u2013 2025, Epic Games, Inc. All rights